Dependancies
============

Sqlkit depends on:

  * Python
  * Pygtk
  * sqlalchemy (>=0.5)
  * glade2
  * dateutils 
  * setuptools
  * the correct driver for your database of choice


Installation
============

please read detail instructions on the web:

  http://sqlkit.argolinux.org/sqlkit/download.html


you may also find interesting information on the installation part of the
tutorial:

  http://sqlkit.argolinux.org/sqlkit/tutorial.html
